{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZeppNambaいぇーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"overture\nおいでシャンプー\n会いたかったかもしれない\nロマンティックいか焼き\n扇風機\nガールズルール\n-MC-\n失いたくないから\n左胸の勇気\nせっかちなかたつむり\n海流の島よ\n他の星から\n指望遠鏡\n-ファッションショー-\n人間という楽器\n-寸劇-\nガールズルール<下駄っぷ>\n-MC(クイズ)-\n走れ！Bicycle\n-MC-\n人はなぜ走るのか？\n世界で一番孤独なLover\n狼に口笛を\n制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[アンコール]\n君の名は希望\nぐるぐるカーテン\n-MC-\n乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寸劇は\nかわたん、飛鳥、ゆったん、なーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズの罰ゲームも\n寸劇の4人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の福岡夜の公演の万歩計は\nメンバーの中で11位でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"順位ちょっと下がってしまった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/27/9027844/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引き続き、頑張ります＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のファッションショーは\n中田もでました(・∀・)\n初めてやった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の髪型は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"編み込み 低めの巻きサイドポニー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/27/9027844/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演始まる前だからレッスン着"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんのツイン可愛すぎ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/27/9027844/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがよく見えた(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとクーラーが\nいつもよりきいてたのか\n快適で楽しく踊れた←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの方は\n涼しかったのかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、盛り上がりすぎて\n暑かったよね？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に来てくれてありがとう＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早めに明日の\nZeppNagoyaの話！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリは今日と違うけど\n今日と同じく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼    若干上手が多め\n夜    若干下手が多め"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーても\nどっちでも見える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}